5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose during the switch.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The budget line hasn't changed. I need to see the actual floor costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should decide who gets the worse seats before we start moving.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is invisible on paper. I need to check the physical setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Who sits next to whom changes how we talk. I want to see the plan.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the cost is high, maybe we keep the current layout?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, not necessarily. I just need the numbers to justify the change.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, what specifically are you looking for?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I want to know if the current spots are actually usable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I think the survey data might help us see the preferences.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m worried about the morning rush.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look into the billing basis.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll check the drawn plan against the survey.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll look at the sound readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the arrival times and what the new joiners said.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Let’s see what we find.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Yes.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
