60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is too chaotic. Option B is costly. Option C is stable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C minimizes the facilities quote. It’s the most economical.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option C allows us to assign the window seats deliberately.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C lets me pick my spot once and adjust it properly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C means I know my neighbors. It’s better for communication.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,But what about the morning setup time?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"With fixed desks, you just plug in. No choosing.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,And we can put the quiet people near the window.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,I can finally get my chair right.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I can build relationships with my neighbors.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I guess Option C is the best compromise.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. The cost savings are significant.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, and it’s fairer.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I’m in.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Let’s vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
